# Waitlist signups from the landing modal are POSTed here as JSON:
# { email, intent: "borrow" | "lend", vault?, source, ts }
# Any URL that accepts a POST works (Zapier / Make catch hook, Google Apps
# Script web app, Loops, Resend, your own endpoint). Unset = signups are only
# logged to the server console.
WAITLIST_WEBHOOK_URL=
